 	 * Endpoint 0 is a control endpoint, so its max packet size may only be
 	 * 8, 16, 32 or 64. This diagnostic path used 512, which is not a legal
@@ -2006,6 +2057,7 @@
 	 * command that never cleared CMDACT. Linux builds ep0 from
